[{"title":"次胡琴所韵","author":"刘崧","text":"旅舍生芳草，书帷映古槐。\n共怜春意入，况值客愁开。\n隔屿花如雾，哄堂笑似雷。\n杯行嫌太缓，故遣短歌催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人赴南安推官","author":"刘崧","text":"横浦西江上，君行驾短艭。\n客程花拂帽，官舍鸟窥窗。\n远别轻千里，高名重一邦。\n辉辉东海日，偏照画旗杠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复出东原寓舍","author":"刘崧","text":"渐喜故园近，况闻征旅稀。\n草间寻旧径，江上问柴扉。\n晓霁泥沾屐，春寒雪满衣。\n东皋须种豆，从此荷锄归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题钓台石","author":"刘崧","text":"拳石立崔嵬，何年控凿开。\n险应非滟滪，奇欲似离堆。\n云气缠高蔓，波光漾紫苔。\n长竿吾欲试，叹息棹歌回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋暮候家僮不至","author":"刘崧","text":"少日疏狂惯，中年感慨同。\n梦啼惊泪雨，坐久怯头风。\n把酒嗔浮蚁，看书惜过鸿。\n故园归渐近，凭问菊花丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"达上麓访吴孟勤不遇二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"杳杳天河路，苍苍暮色寒。\n千峰引云树，孤棹入风湍。\n旧别嗟谁在，新诗忆共看。\n怜君好毛羽，何处觅琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"达上麓访吴孟勤不遇二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"忆过山中路，都无半日程。\n如何不相见，从此又南征。\n江海时舟楫，边隅尚甲兵。\n相思摇落景，回首飒心惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张氏溪亭杂兴四首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"草阁经秋净，柴扉近水开。\n霜林收橘柚，风磴坐莓苔。\n钓艇寒初放，樵歌晚独回。\n城南车马地，欲往更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张氏溪亭杂兴四首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"水落沈菰米，亭深暗女萝。\n捲帘秋雾薄，倚杖白云多。\n点点流萤下，翩翩宿鸟过。\n秋高摇落近，幽兴欲如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张氏溪亭杂兴四首 其三","author":"刘崧","text":"寒雾依山敛，晴沙与岸颓。\n林塘无路入，窗户有时开。\n野客抄书去，邻翁送酒来。\n幽期在萝薜，莫遣暮钟催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张氏溪亭杂兴四首 其四","author":"刘崧","text":"鸟径缘沙小，鱼梁叠石高。\n细流通乱屿，杂树带平皋。\n白鹭怡心性，青禽惜羽毛。\n由来林下客，偃仰愧尘劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳灵洞二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"窅窅青牛峡，荒荒白鹤坛。\n石山元少树，阴洞故多寒。\n帝子非秦女，将军自汉官。\n乘云知不返，叹息万人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳灵洞二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"仙宇何年辟，灵泉尽日闻。\n石门通别殿，木栈倚高云。\n鸾凤时来下，猕猴近作群。\n春风城郭暮，烟雾正纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下苍山西麓将问道过金精是日赵伯友与客先赴山中闻已出谷口相候喜赋","author":"刘崧","text":"上马愁将夕，题诗念友生。\n苍茫惊独往，迢递愧相迎。\n崖涌青莲色，溪流碧玉声。\n登临馀我辈，应不负高情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯友夜半酒醒戏举一首","author":"刘崧","text":"对酒不能饮，高人方醉眠。\n衣裳侵石冷，冠帻挂云偏。\n地迥星联户，风澄露满天。\n冥冥清夜过，惊起问初筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪景画","author":"刘崧","text":"山阁雪初暝，石床天正寒。\n亦愁江上听，秪益坐中看。\n竹树低仍压，茅茨湿未乾。\n谁能添小艓，来把钓鱼竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夏定夫归进贤","author":"刘崧","text":"从师劳远涉，归兴及清秋。\n即此催还觐，相看动别愁。\n天垂阴洞碧，云入暮山稠。\n犹忆谈经夜，松亭月色幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋石龙山","author":"刘崧","text":"柳氏堂前石，崭岩故似龙。\n泥沙排异质，烟雾失奇踪。\n槛竹秋阴覆，阶苔夕雨封。\n鳌溪未能往，凝想最高峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮甸 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"淮甸今焚掠，纷纷日异闻。\n远侵三楚地，近隔九江云。\n邻省围边将，亲王进卫军。\n由来王国内，不在策奇勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮甸 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"始报修城障，仍闻铸甲兵。\n关河原阻滞，宇宙划经营。\n不谓时当尔，终然法再更。\n边圉岂忘备，万一向清平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题米元晖山水小景","author":"刘崧","text":"江上见青峰，亭亭三四重。\n雨沾金翡翠，云拥玉芙蓉。\n桂屿閒秋馆，枫林隐暮钟。\n苍茫图画意，欲赏惜无从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋碧梧","author":"刘崧","text":"庭前碧梧叶，秋至总离离。\n不记远移处，忽惊初落时。\n色分云际石，影乱月中池。\n凤鸟几时至，凄凉青玉枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏园观赤文挹射弓","author":"刘崧","text":"公子杏园中，邀人射角弓。\n张弦惊满月，鸣镝应长风。\n力倚千钧重，心期一中工。\n清秋鞍马健，莫谩拟飞鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚出西关","author":"刘崧","text":"戈戟重门固，风尘过客稀。\n飞禽愁战格，屯卒怪儒衣。\n野旷北风劲，天高西日微。\n苍茫愁满眼，欲往惜心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江阁晚望次严焕韵","author":"刘崧","text":"落日明秋燧，江空生夕波。\n阁前歌吹少，城下战船多。\n望眼悬飞檄，愁心倚太阿。\n王师犹驻马，谁遣问如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋战旗得营字","author":"刘崧","text":"疾风吹大旗，西出洛阳城。\n鸢鸟并飞动，熊虎歘纵横。\n披拂中军帐，飘扬列骑营。\n万人回首处，太白独分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同孔元月赤文挹王子启严焕宴集闻公房得新字","author":"刘崧","text":"跨牛庵下路，秋日往来频。\n何处无芳草，多应有故人。\n座分禅榻旧，门拥戟旗新。\n且复临尊酒，微吟远世尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"刘崧","text":"江浦低云雁，墀阶起露萤。\n一灯寒炯炯，乱叶夜冥冥。\n城迥闻征柝，檐虚见落星。\n时来对尊酒，亦足慰飘零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登易氏山后小亭","author":"刘崧","text":"乱石危峰下，孤亭众木间。\n藤萝深结络，阑槛极跻攀。\n啼鸟青烟隔，游丝白日閒。\n风尘满城市，怅望不知还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红缨白帽","author":"刘崧","text":"白帽缀红缨，军容喜称情。\n兜鍪知较古，贝胄比还轻。\n上马秋风动，归营夜雪明。\n少年趍幕府，岸帻尽谈兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示刘生","author":"刘崧","text":"林塘子故物，风景最宜诗。\n暂去还相见，閒吟亦自奇。\n冰霜惊岁晏，戎马惜时危。\n雅道今如此，古人端可师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"快阁春望次王子启","author":"刘崧","text":"使者徵兵去，居民避地回。\n南风犹鼓角，北岸自楼台。\n白水晴云动，青山暮雨来。\n百年旧城郭，临眺独兴哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐子启竹林","author":"刘崧","text":"爱尔幽栖处，门前青竹林。\n石床三伏冷，池水一春深。\n野鸟来窥户，溪鱼出听琴。\n无因谢羁束，携酒日相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月十六日观内省使臣传诏到州","author":"刘崧","text":"闻道京华使，南从海上来。\n丁宁深激义，沈痛欲兴哀。\n远道经年达，华筵尽日开。\n灵槎万里外，飘泊几时回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美梁太守总兵大洲","author":"刘崧","text":"太守威名重，中军节制专。\n城池百战里，藩屏数州先。\n兵帐江云动，戈船野雾连。\n时危仗经济，感激万人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":23699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e